{"job_id":"F-be4a5422cf0d35305809","family_id":"F-be4a5422cf0d35305809","title":"육군종합행정학교령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":9,"target_id":"e4d4a699b7d96f7417a5979de38597f80875fff5265233f6cf022d951c4450fc","source_hash":"5440b7bfe7e907af780f5427b1665e9591dc8fbd2bc0388bfb492ca8d33b2c71","text":"陆军综合管理学校命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":162,"target_id":"3c765c7167b1039b582bb3273770a46e5e7f3c60e22c0fe3e8e09e0168ccb711","source_hash":"166006947e43c8452c5973ea0278cd633572fe0578dbf0c588c08793774392c0","text":"第 1 条（安装和任务）\n①陆军应设立陆军总务学校。<1999年2月26日修订>\n② 陆军总务学校负责开展陆军财务、宪兵、人事、法律事务和军事牧师方面的教育和培训，并制定必要的理论。<1999年2月26日修订；2017年11月14日修订；2019年6月25日修订；2020年2月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":162,"end":321,"target_id":"c1f208c7fbb45e2740a6ad8a0c5863ac4202112628e4065bcdafcefdb4c3c3d8","source_hash":"53b8e6072b837f8529e805b993f5b4b0734f2f82ecd968fa504fa45ff0d0ccca","text":"第 2 条（主要）\n① 陆军总务学校（以下简称“总务学校”）应设校长一职。<1999年2月26日修订>\n②校长应从陆军将官或二级及以上文职军事人员中任命。<2025年9月2日修订>\n校长奉陆军参谋长的命令，负责学校事务，指挥和监督下属人员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":321,"end":476,"target_id":"eb47e21be0c11cebfb832b05408def8687ee9009bc193e08bcb4b9f635d18330","source_hash":"969262739413a86f569467eb8c79c667c8f87109c63eb716e7a4a7f79290da10","text":"第三条（单位和部门的设立）\n① 设立行政管理学院所需单位及部门。<1999年2月26日修订>\n② 根据第一款规定设立的部队的设立、任务和组织事宜，由国防部长决定；各部门的设立和职责划分事宜，由陆军参谋长决定。<1999年2月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":476,"end":540,"target_id":"13afebdae6dc61de028c9b076911e9ddedc4c3071f5edab13fc9208784684197","source_hash":"67f43711773dc47632e293d56c8724f36befc5bbbfb5f2149c30e72e3d95e013","text":"第四条（课程等）陆军参谋长应当确定综合行政学校的课程、课时以及其他必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":540,"end":588,"target_id":"f339383908a5fe81ec7ca544f30d3e12074da6d49403aa3d8abe77b4aed43242","source_hash":"e27645f03fbeca309050439786113bf2844dc5868aafd20395337c7491f49b28","text":"第五条（人员配额）军事人员和文职军事雇员应驻扎在综合行政学校，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":588,"end":711,"target_id":"19fcf39994fb4cf0492f7c8bdbdada656ac6939e8c508b9a5810cb10ad90d1f6","source_hash":"df81a5c5227e0ec4a7306991fa5e8967f28a400533cd26b889d0df18018b27fd","text":"第六条（海军和空军人员的教育）  陆军参谋长经海军参谋长或空军参谋长请求，经国防部长批准，可在总务学校为海军或空军人员举办教育。<1999年2月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":711,"end":760,"target_id":"d63811af4611926726f03ca9138b5dc0ced7be78b296368f5c727ad088368485","source_hash":"ea513d1fe5a9222dc550306fa92b4bca2b72ae3be52dc74c54b2fc32b2b8a0bb","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 11041，1983 年 2 月 1 日>\n\n本法令自1983年2月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":760,"end":793,"target_id":"fe4f56362ae180618ed97899dd6435e1ce053628443e13645973465974c92ead","source_hash":"c72121d5f653513c190fe5e5610dea0327c927771a442a2549941f8ab3f0544f","text":"附录（《军事人员法》实施令》）<1992年8月13日第13708号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":793,"end":823,"target_id":"0970413d12b245f79ea0ec5fe60d9f28017e7fb8ed62f22641db7c345fc88f09","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":823,"end":876,"target_id":"4127687b8d64ac41c9cc31292cb2cf73d8429101d850e808f53eef70992a28a6","source_hash":"f914eac09563ccf4569fb7b18a55c757a40118493b4a42b5fac30c37eeea0118","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至③ 已省略\n\n  ④ 陆军总务学校法令修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":876,"end":932,"target_id":"b3196fcefde661a3878cb65e570da00c334654098b5c10d99d070e20bef0e9f5","source_hash":"0a93ce5a31136935768ddc4ecfc67417fd0da5b770540c89f320695165c677b8","text":"第二条第二款如下。\n\n  ②校长应被任命为陆军将领。\n\n  ⑤ 至 ⑨ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":932,"end":976,"target_id":"f4b96044dd2cd959458cc5627b44cce9fa2b087350fdc4e4c49d3344d18110df","source_hash":"857041fcc23fe464205b0391da44c4ab987bb3c1692f716725fc0cc77ed4a0d7","text":"补充规定 <第16121号，1999年2月26日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":976,"end":1009,"target_id":"0f1f8997d586432830aa96563cc9fee7e67db295f0e7b3edad1155aeac879615","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1009,"end":1046,"target_id":"75739cd5c68d14e6bd1b8b68df62dd59cc3b9b7d917fe9331ae9af2bb17bc90e","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1046,"end":1060,"target_id":"3b8b640b0a586428e27d9252d1b471be569267722493b3737bc165fd56ec2134","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第 2 条和第 3 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1060,"end":1181,"target_id":"57a7dfc06163699b81580a5973fd1d12924bc9a41e7ca18843a1e68424b28644","source_hash":"75e42054009c3743e481eecb8196a47f68208eb3d37164eba254175d33657b7f","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<67>款省略\n\n  <68> 关于陆军综合行政学校的法令部分修改如下。\n\n  第 2 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <69> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1181,"end":1226,"target_id":"f1b7f00dbe2b4bfa662a3f498f3581cd90d73120b535d623784c2931cd7895d5","source_hash":"84946ac67d927126c70fdd8e65bc07e395c8278eea6573aca36ceae7bcc0f2bf","text":"补充规定 <第28429号，2017年11月14日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1226,"end":1260,"target_id":"6efc91b5e43a260a29dd51b48221a5a33f106ef30fedbd98601c4d4a66f87418","source_hash":"f90189c404230e1d8e5011f98e5e3b322da94ee171048c4eb82fb0c80ced9a2e","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令）<第29894号，2019年6月25日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1260,"end":1297,"target_id":"07670fdb23940fdc83aaa371b017ac2e63e13e448c6cda07e3b14333147da4f4","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1297,"end":1397,"target_id":"9ed3c0f838768796822eaddcf269cd282ba093f573b939b6cb5da7b9a33a07ad","source_hash":"dd81c35dc6baaec4dab94b7b09f3f7b29def33c7d8d66a11495322e2c4a3e494","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①和②已省略\n\n  ③ 关于陆军综合管理学校的法令部分修改如下。\n\n  第1条第2款中的“人事管理”应改为“人事”。 \n\n  ④ 和 ⑤ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1397,"end":1430,"target_id":"a244c75ffa835aa8da4cedec85c51c54b8ac8c71bb55f30638dfa028f34d4c8a","source_hash":"592eb80891286d5fb32a1790211980c68a1497bf93015531466ed1a1121402b3","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令》）<第30384号，2020年2月4日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1430,"end":1459,"target_id":"d2e2318acdfdfad239080209f188426daab554af9fa2fb99c92a70dba776bfa0","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1459,"end":1467,"target_id":"16c6c73704962d13b9e3a243a6a7ef9082a383e635bc7c695cf5f446a552ebf0","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1467,"end":1570,"target_id":"4b2a884647e8906e09dc5e11e340e7faa34c3b907aa7c31b768d3d760e47eb5c","source_hash":"f2f1579b893a40e7b48d87c78d679f675bcd2b5e7fe5a5180927bbd1fd6834e1","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至⑩ 省略\n\n  ⑪ 陆军综合行政学校法令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第 1 条第 2 款中的“宪兵”应改为“宪兵”。\n\n  省略 ⑫ 到 ⑭\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1570,"end":1578,"target_id":"0a3926ae5bc3d6ffc648dd0ed771d98f0f072f2ec0346c244a21cb3ac9362a96","source_hash":"fab18bd1e0d74a271eea817ca2d5dff62d53ec4d5214a8c48af3c4adbab54a93","text":"第 3 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004443-273561-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1578,"end":1662,"target_id":"7d404733e31ce366c4b852610abf6687a0e5404e3d6f27e477439d614d1c3a4c","source_hash":"12fb47a24a8a8d48c76b328876ef72f13041b533e51fcc7761110c3332d77371","text":"增补（关于部分修改九项法令以提高军事组织运作效率的总统令）<第35726号，2025年9月2日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}